              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CJWILBURN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my new favorite summer side dish! I made it to go with barbecue and it was a big hit. I used 2 cans of black eyed peas, and substituted roasted red peppers for pimentos, otherwise followed the recipe exactly.",
