              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Audrey Spear"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great stuff! I used a little less corn (not much of a corn fan, but it's a beautiful contrast), omitted the optional celery (ICK) and substituted fresh green onions from my garden. You can't get much better than this for a side dish! A little spicy - but that's the way I like it! :D",
